display_name = "Insulated Weave"
description = "Vulcanized cloth over a dead-air lattice. It stops nothing with mass -- no plate, no bracing, and a bolt still lands its jolt -- but current finds no road through it: the shock never takes, and the storm passes without leaving a mark."
